{"title": "Fey Life", "pageid": 28511, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Fey_Life", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Fey Life</b> is a passive feature that makes the wearer more likely to survive unconsciousness.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Makes it easier for the wearer to succeed on <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Death Saving Throw\">death saving throws</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tarnished_Charm\" title=\"Tarnished Charm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Tarnished_Charm_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Tarnished_Charm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Tarnished_Charm_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Tarnished_Charm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Tarnished_Charm_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Tarnished_Charm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Tarnished_Charm_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Tarnished_Charm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Tarnished_Charm_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Tarnished_Charm\" title=\"Tarnished Charm\">Tarnished Charm</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Auntie_Ethel\" title=\"Auntie Ethel\">Auntie Ethel</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Fey Life lowers the <a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Death Saving Throw\">death saving throws</a> for the wearer from 10 to 5.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714205111\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.037 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 852/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6815/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1566/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 139/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 688930/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   33.139      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   33.139      1 -total\n 52.90%   17.531      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 47.09%   15.606      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 43.52%   14.423      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n 22.05%    7.306      1 Template:Item_icon\n 11.97%    3.966      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.99%    3.643      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 10.08%    3.340      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n  9.21%    3.053      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28511-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714205111 and revision id 371043. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}